---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /artifacts/index.html
title: Artifact Inventory
---

<header class="section-head">
  <h1>Artifact Inventory</h1>
  <p class="section-head__note">
    Five accessions. Three are held by the Archive, one is on loan, and one
    is unaccounted for. All five are catalogued.
  </p>
</header>

<ul class="index-list">
  {% for doc in collections.artifact %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ doc.url | url }}">{{ doc.data.title }}</a>
      <span class="index-list__meta">
        {{ doc.data.accession_number }} &middot; {{ doc.data.status }}
      </span>
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

<p class="caption">
  Artifact photography is held offsite and has not been digitised.
</p>
